ebui or API\r\nstep3: When you choose to remove the SAML SSO authentication, via cmk : authorize samlsso enable=false userid=myuser id\r\nstep4: Try to login on webui with failure :)\r\n~~~\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n##### EXPECTED RESULTS\r\nUser should be able to login on cloudstack web UI\r\nWhen SSO is disable the field \"source\" on user table is SAML2DISABLED\r\nWhen SSO has never been activated (and user is able to login via cloudstack directly) this field must be UNKNOWN.\r\n\r\n##### ACTUAL RESULTS\r\nUser can't login on cloudstack web UI\r\n","comments":5,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/6672/comments","created_at":"2022-08-24T16:23:19Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/6672/events","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/cloudstack/issues/6672","id":1349721393,"labels":[{"color":"a5f9ff","default":false,"description":"","id":817420428,"name":"type:improvement","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4MTc0MjA0Mjg=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/type:improvement"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/6672/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":{"closed_issues":112,"created_at":"2026-04-13T07:02:43Z","creator":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12028987?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sureshanaparti","id":12028987,"login":"sureshanaparti","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMDI4OTg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/repos","site_admin":false,"starred