quot;Noto Sans Devanagari\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Noto Sans Bengali UI\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Noto Sans Bengali\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Noto Sans Telugu UI\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Noto Sans Telugu\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Noto Sans Tamil UI\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Noto Sans Tamil\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Noto Sans Gujarati UI\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Noto Sans Gujarati\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Noto Sans Kannada UI\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Noto Sans Kannada\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Noto Sans Malayalam UI\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Noto Sans Malayalam\u0026quot;, Thonburi, \u0026quot;Leelawadee UI\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Noto Sans Thai UI\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Noto Sans Thai\u0026quot;, Kefa, Ebrima, \u0026quot;Noto Sans Ethiopic\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Abyssinica SIL\u0026quot;, sans-serif, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \u0026quot;Segoe UI\u0026quot;, Roboto, \u0026quot;PingFang SC\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;PingFang TC\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Hiragino Sans\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo\u0026quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(26, 26, 25); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid color(srgb 1 1 1 / 0.1); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: rgb(85, 152, 231); scrollbar-width: thin; app-region: initial; text-rendering: optimizelegibility;\"\u003eVM work jobs are serialized\u003cspan\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid color(srgb 1 1 1 / 0.1); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: rgb(85, 152, 231); scrollbar-width: thin; app-region: initial; font-weight: 500; --cds-font-axis-wght: \u0026quot;wght\u0026quot; 560,; font-variation-settings: \u0026quot;GRAD\u0026quot; 0, \u0026quot;wght\u0026quot; 560; text-rendering: optimizelegibility;\"\u003eper VM, not per volume\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c/span\u003e— so a detach of volume V from VM-A and an attach of volume V to VM-B run on independent queues with no ordering guarantee.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid color(srgb 1 1 1 / 0.1); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: rgb(85, 152, 231); scrollbar-width: thin; app-region: initial; text-rendering: optimizelegibility;\"\u003eClients that retry (Kubernetes CSI external-attacher, ~60 s retry) stack multiple identical\u003cspan\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003ccode data-epitaxy-inline-code=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid color(srgb 1 1 1 / 0.1); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: rgb(85, 152, 231); scrollbar-width: thin; app-region: initial; font-family: anthropic-mono, ui-monospace, monospace, \u0026quot;SF Mono\u0026quot;, ui-monospace, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-feature-settings: \u0026quot;calt\u0026quot; 0, \u0026quot;liga\u0026quot; 0; font-variation-settings: normal; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box color(srgb 1 1 1 / 0.05); color: rgb(240, 239, 236); border-radius: 4px; padding-block: 1px; padding-inline: 2px; line-height: 1.4;\"\u003eDetachVolume\u003c/code\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c/span\u003ejobs on the source VM's queue. The first succeeds; the stragglers also \"succeed\" later.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid color(srgb 1 1 1 / 0.1); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: rgb(85, 152, 231); scrollbar-width: thin; app-region: initial; text-rendering: optimizelegibility;\"\u003eThe straggler's completion path clears\u003cspan\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003ccode data-epitaxy-inline-code=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid color(srgb 1 1 1 / 0.1); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: rgb(85, 152, 231); scrollbar-width: thin; app-region: initial; font-family: anthropic-mono, ui-monospace, monospace, \u0026quot;SF Mono\u0026quot;, ui-monospace, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-feature-settings: \u0026quot;calt\u0026quot; 0, \u0026quot;liga\u0026quot; 0; font-variation-settings: normal; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box color(srgb 1 1 1 / 0.05); color: rgb(240, 239, 236); border-radius: 4px; padding-block: 1px; padding-inline: 2px; line-height: 1.4;\"\u003evolumes.instance_id\u003c/code\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c/span\u003e/\u003cspan\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003ccode data-epitaxy-inline-code=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid color(srgb 1 1 1 / 0.1); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: rgb(85, 152, 231); scrollbar-width: thin; app-region: initial; font-family: anthropic-mono, ui-monospace, monospace, \u0026quot;SF Mono\u0026quot;, ui-monospace, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-feature-settings: \u0026quot;calt\u0026quot; 0, \u0026quot;liga\u0026quot; 0; font-variation-settings: normal; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box color(srgb 1 1 1 / 0.05); color: rgb(240, 239, 236); border-radius: 4px; padding-block: 1px; padding-inline: 2px; line-height: 1.4;\"\u003edevice_id\u003c/code\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid color(srgb 1 1 1 / 0.1); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: rgb(85, 152, 231); scrollbar-width: thin; app-region: initial; font-weight: 500; --cds-font-axis-wght: \u0026quot;wght\u0026quot; 560,; font-variation-settings: \u0026quot;GRAD\u0026quot; 0, \u0026quot;wght\u0026quot; 560; text-rendering: optimizelegibility;\"\u003ewithout verifying the row still refers to the attachment it detached\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c/span\u003e— no compare-and-swap. If the volume was re-attached in the meantime, the\u003cspan\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003cem style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid color(srgb 1 1 1 / 0.1); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: rgb(85, 152, 231); scrollbar-width: thin; app-region: initial; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; font-style: italic;\"\u003enew\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c/span\u003eattachment's state is destroyed.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid color(srgb 1 1 1 / 0.1); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: rgb(85, 152, 231); scrollbar-width: thin; app-region: initial; text-rendering: optimizelegibility;\"\u003eThe corrupting event logs at INFO level as a successful detach — nothing flags the inconsistency until a later attach collides.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid color(srgb 1 1 1 / 0.1); margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; outline-color: rgb(85, 152, 231); scrollbar-width: thin; app-region: initial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 580; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; font-variation-settings: \u0026quot;wght\u0026quot; 540; letter-spacing: -0.01em; margin-block: 20px 6px; padding-block: 0px; color: rgb(240, 239, 236); font-family: anthropic-sans, system-ui, \u0026quot;Segoe UI\u0026quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, \u0026quot;PingFang SC\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;PingFang TC\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Hiragino Sans\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Kohinoor Devanagari\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Kohinoor Bangla\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Kohinoor Telugu\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Tamil Sangam MN\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Kohinoor Gujarati\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Malayalam Sangam MN\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Nirmala UI\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Noto Sans Devanagari UI\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Noto Sans Devanagar